<!doctype html>
  <html lang="en">
    <head>
      <meta charset="UTF-8" />
      <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
      <title>Annexure-I &amp; Proforma-A</title>
      <style>
        /* fonts via base-report.css */
  
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
  
        body {
          font-family: 'Open Sans', 'Noto Sans', Arial, sans-serif;
          font-size: 9pt;
          color: #1a1a1a;
          background: #fff;
        }
  
        .pdf-page {
          page-break-inside: auto;
          break-inside: auto;
        }
  
        /* ── MAHAVITARAN HEADER ── */
        .maha-header {
          display: block;
          text-align: center;
          padding: 10px 16px;
          border: 1px solid #ccc;
          margin-bottom: 0;
        }
  
        .maha-header .title-cell {
          text-align: center;
        }
  
        .maha-header .title-cell .org-name {
          font-size: 12pt;
          font-weight: 700;
          color: #1a1a1a;
          line-height: 1.4;
        }
  
        /* ── DOC TITLE BLOCK ── */
        .doc-title-block {
          text-align: center;
          margin: 14px 0 10px 0;
        }
  
        .doc-title-block .main-title {
          font-size: 13pt;
          font-weight: 700;
          color: #1a1a1a;
        }
  
        .doc-title-block .sub-title {
          font-size: 11pt;
          font-weight: 700;
          color: #1a1a1a;
          margin-top: 2px;
        }
  
        .doc-title-block .sub-sub-title {
          font-size: 10pt;
          font-weight: 400;
          color: #444;
          margin-top: 2px;
        }
  
        /* ── MAIN TABLE ── */
        table.main-table {
          font-size: 8.5pt;
        }
  
        /*
         * Background is set on th/td (not tr) — html2canvas (used for client-side
         * PDF export) unreliably paints background-color set on <tr>/<thead>
         * elements, especially combined with border-collapse. Cell-level
         * background is rendered correctly by both the browser preview and
         * html2canvas.
         */
        table.main-table thead th {
          padding: 7px 10px;
          font-weight: 600;
          text-align: left;
          border: 1px solid #1a1a1a;
          background: #1a1a1a;
          color: #fff;
        }
  
        table.main-table thead th:first-child {
          width: 8%;
          text-align: center;
        }
  
        table.main-table thead th:nth-child(2) {
          width: 42%;
        }
  
        table.main-table tbody tr:nth-child(even) td { background: #f5f5f5; }
        table.main-table tbody tr:nth-child(odd) td  { background: #ffffff; }
  
        table.main-table tbody td {
          padding: 6px 10px;
          border: 1px solid #cccccc;
          vertical-align: top;
          line-height: 1.5;
          page-break-inside: avoid;
          break-inside: avoid;
        }
  
        table.main-table tbody td:first-child {
          text-align: center;
          font-weight: 600;
        }
  
        table.main-table tbody td.label { font-weight: 600; }
  
        table.main-table tbody td.label-sub {
          font-weight: 400;
          color: #444;
          padding-left: 22px;
        }
  
        /* ── PROFORMA-A ── */
        .proforma-title-block {
          text-align: center;
          margin-bottom: 16px;
          /* Page 2 starts at the sheet's edge after the break: give it page 1's 12mm. */
          padding-top: 12mm;
        }
  
        .proforma-title-block .p-heading {
          font-size: 11pt;
          font-weight: 700;
          color: #1a1a1a;
          line-height: 1.5;
        }
  
        .proforma-body {
          font-size: 10pt;
          line-height: 1.8;
          color: #1a1a1a;
          text-align: justify;
          margin-bottom: 32px;
          page-break-inside: avoid;
          break-inside: avoid;
        }
  
        .proforma-final {
          margin-top: 32px;
          font-size: 10pt;
          line-height: 1.8;
          color: #1a1a1a;
          text-align: justify;
          page-break-inside: avoid;
          break-inside: avoid;
        }
  
      </style>
    </head>
    <body>
      <div class="pdf-wrapper">
  
        <!-- ═══════════════════════════ PAGE 1 — ANNEXURE-I ═══════════════════════════ -->
        <div class="pdf-page">
  
          <div class="maha-header">
            <div class="title-cell">
              <div class="org-name">Maharashtra State Electricity Distribution Co. Ltd.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
  
          <div class="doc-title-block">
            <div class="main-title">Renewable Energy Generating System</div>
            <div class="sub-title">Annexure- I</div>
            <div class="sub-sub-title">(Commissioning Report for RE System)</div>
          </div>
  
          <table class="main-table">
            <colgroup>
              <col style="width: 8%" />
              <col style="width: 42%" />
              <col style="width: 50%" />
            </colgroup>
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>S No</th>
                <th>Particulars</th>
                <th>As commissioned</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td>1</td>
                <td class="label">Name of the Consumer</td>
                <td>{{consumer_name}}</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>2</td>
                <td class="label">Consumer Number</td>
                <td>{{consumer_number}}</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>3</td>
                <td class="label">Mobile Number</td>
                <td>{{consumer_phone}}</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>4</td>
                <td class="label">E-mail</td>
                <td>{{consumer_email}}</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>5</td>
                <td class="label">Address of Installation</td>
                <td>{{site_address}}</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>6</td>
                <td class="label">RE Arrangement Type</td>
                <td>{{re_arrangement_type}}</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>7</td>
                <td class="label">RE Source</td>
                <td>{{re_source}}</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>8</td>
                <td class="label">Sanctioned Capacity(KW)</td>
                <td>{{sanctioned_capacity_kw}}</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>9</td>
                <td class="label">Capacity Type</td>
                <td>{{capacity_type}}</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>10</td>
                <td class="label">Project Model</td>
                <td>{{project_model}}</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>11</td>
                <td class="label">RE installed Capacity(Rooftop)(KW)</td>
                <td>{{re_installed_capacity_rooftop_kw}}</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>12</td>
                <td class="label">RE installed Capacity(Rooftop + Ground)(KW)</td>
                <td>{{re_installed_capacity_rooftop_ground_kw}}</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>13</td>
                <td class="label">RE installed Capacity(Ground)(KW)</td>
                <td>{{re_installed_capacity_ground_kw}}</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>14</td>
                <td class="label">Installation date</td>
                <td>{{installation_date}}</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>15</td>
                <td class="label" colspan="2">Solar PV Details</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td></td>
                <td class="label-sub">Inverter Capacity(KW)</td>
                <td>{{inverter_total_kw}}</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td></td>
                <td class="label-sub">Inverter Make</td>
                <td>{{inverter_make}}</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td></td>
                <td class="label-sub">No. of PV Modules</td>
                <td>{{module_count}}</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td></td>
                <td class="label-sub">Module Capacity (KW)</td>
                <td>{{module_total_kw}}</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
  
          <!-- Signatures as on the WCR: space to sign, the name above the line, the role below. -->
          <div class="rpt-sig-row" style="margin-top: 36px">
            {{> signature name=installation_date role="Date"}}
            {{> signature name=consumer_name role="Signature of Consumer"}}
          </div>
  
        </div><!-- end page 1 -->
  
        <!-- hard page break — html2pdf cuts exactly here -->
        <div class="pdf-page-break"></div>
  
        <!-- ═══════════════════════════ PAGE 2 — PROFORMA-A ═══════════════════════════ -->
        <div class="pdf-page">

          <div class="proforma-title-block">
            <div class="p-heading">Proforma-A</div>
            <div class="p-heading">COMMISSIONING REPORT (PROVISIONAL) FOR GRID CONNECTED SOLAR</div>
            <div class="p-heading">PHOTOVOLTAIC POWER PLANT (with Net-metering facility)</div>
          </div>
  
          <p class="proforma-body">
            Certified that a Grid Connected SPV Power Plant of <strong>{{dash
            installed_capacity_kw}} KWp</strong> capacity has been installed at the site
            <strong>{{dash site_address}}</strong> District <strong>{{dash site_city}}</strong>
            of <strong>{{dash site_state}}</strong> which has been installed by M/S <strong>{{dash
            vendor_name}}</strong> On <strong>{{dash installation_date}}</strong> The system is as per
            BIS/MNRE specifications. The system has been checked for its performance and found in
            order for further commissioning.
          </p>
  
          <div class="rpt-sig-row">
            {{> signature name=consumer_name role="Signature of the beneficiary"}}
            {{> signature name=vendor_name role="Signature of the agency with name, seal and date"}}
          </div>
  
          <p class="proforma-final">
            The above RTS installation has been inspected by me for Pre-Commissioning Testing of Roof Top Solar Connection on date as per guidelines issued by the office of The Chief Engineer vide letter no 21653 on dt. 18.08.2022 and found in order for commissioning.
          </p>
  
          <div class="rpt-sig-row" style="margin-top: 28px">
            {{> signature name="" role="Signature of the MSEDCL Officer (name)"}}
            <div></div>
          </div>
  
        </div><!-- end page 2 -->
  
      </div><!-- end pdf-wrapper -->
    </body>
  </html>